      "ko": "반환 값",
      "sourceHash": "4329767c30021f6eaae64eded9b3b1f59c1b1fe672ac5d4a30e3324691f43a1d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:return-value:0008:0001",
      "source": "An asynchronous sequence that contains, in order, the elements of the base sequence that satisfy the given predicate.",
      "ko": "주어진 조건자를 만족하는 기본 시퀀스의 요소를 순서대로 포함하는 비동기 시퀀스를 생성합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "001b547d1dd17aa2d0802614eda33ae54d519d4d910da392251e0a58cc3b6cf5",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "Discussion",
      "ko": "Discussion",
      "sourceHash": "5eb6cf647d2c5d14a044e2d103dcef4cf0cdc872434c374debc1043092bc4746",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "In this example, an asynchronous sequence called `Counter` produces `Int` values from `1` to `10`.",
      "ko": "이 예제에서 `Counter`라는 비동기 시퀀스는 `1`에서 `10`까지의 `Int` 값을 생성합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "1f7626545a0e12ba857d2990fe6e1beeb09c6f119a2f26fafb7630bf9af5a6f3",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0002",
      "source": "The `filter(_:)` method returns `true` for even values and `false` for odd values, thereby filtering out the odd values:",
      "ko": "`filter(_:)` 메서드는 짝수 값에 대해 `true`를, 홀수 값에 대해 `false`를 반환하므로 홀수 값이 필터링됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "b4eb9543dd03e646f6f3fd751a348381c8a57403223a5adf939ce5d065a0073c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nlet stream = Counter(howHigh: 10)\n    .filter { $0 % 2 == 0 }\nfor await number in stream {\n    print(number, terminator: \" \")\n}\n// Prints \"2 4 6 8 10 \"\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nlet stream = Counter(howHigh: 10)\n    .filter { $0 % 2 == 0 }\nfor await number in stream {\n    print(number, terminator: \" \")\n}\n// Prints \"2 4 6 8 10 \"\n```",
      "sourceHash": "49f208ff3a69751ec240da194ddc4e6a4fd8f28c3c7d414df8d0747448c7b58c",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:parameters:0012:0001",
      "source": "Parameters",
      "ko": "Parameters",
      "sourceHash": "e68b36b17cbd990802f57741cb75cf3a73fa66a61999b0cd70e3cf7d26cfb25f",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0013:0001",
      "source": "`isIncluded`: A closure that takes an element of the   asynchronous sequence as its argument and returns a Boolean value   that indicates whether to include the element in the filtered sequence.",
      "ko": "`isIncluded`: 비동기 시퀀스의 요소를 인수로 받아 필터링된 시퀀스에 해당 요소를 포함할지 여부를 나타내는 Boolean 값을 반환하는 클로저입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "02f4c0d10b631be37657f0b355d2c7169072b5a428c01ef0396d67ada0044552",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
